Besides Evade, most Burgle Cats have a secondary unique ability in battle. All these abilities require SP to use, which can be gained from exploring the Manor. Cats of higher rarities will have more effective abilities.

Below is the list of abilities found in The Burgle Cats. Specs increase base on rarity of the burgle Cat. SP cost decreases linearly base on number of the Cat's duplicates and type of ability (MAX: 10 duplicates).

